      "content": "CHIPPERFIELD           \tTOWER HILL TL 00 SW  \t\t\t\t\t(East side)                                       6/94                           \t\t\tStable at                                        \t\tFrenches Farm                                        \t\t(next to road) GV                                     \t\tII Stable. C17, W wall altered in C19. Timber frame, infilled with brick at N end, dark weatherboarded on E and S, flint and brick wall replacing timber frame on W to roadside. Steep old red tile roof. 3 stables in-line complete and in use. Clasped-purlin roof with queen-strut and collar trusses. Slots for braces to tie-beams. Included for group value. Listing NGR: TL0379502189"
    }
